/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (We used the dateparser library to accurately extract dates, even when they appear in various formats. Additionally, the python-Levenshtein library helps us compare strings to match skills from the resume with predefined keywords in the projects, internships, and work experience sections. By combining these tools, we can effectively link skills to their corresponding experience timelines, improving the overall quality of resume parsing and making the skills more relevant in the final output.)
/E (We used the dateparser library to accurately extract dates, even when they appear in various formats. Additionally, the python-Levenshtein library helps us compare strings to match skills from the resume with predefined keywords in the projects, internships, and work experience sections. By combining these tools, we can effectively link skills to their corresponding experience timelines, improving the overall quality of resume parsing and making the skills more relevant in the final output.)
