<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The process of generating sub-queries starts by inputting user queries into a Large Language Model \(LLM\) agent. This allows complex job requirements to be broken down into specific sub-queries that focus on individual aspects. This breakdown is achieved using a carefully designed prompt that consists of a fixed system prompt for consistent guidance and a dynamic user prompt tailored to the specific job requirement. This approach ensures that the LLM analyzes job requirements like an expert recruiter, relying solely on the provided information to minimize inaccuracies.)
/E (The process of generating sub-queries starts by inputting user queries into a Large Language Model \(LLM\) agent. This allows complex job requirements to be broken down into specific sub-queries that focus on individual aspects. This breakdown is achieved using a carefully designed prompt that consists of a fixed system prompt for consistent guidance and a dynamic user prompt tailored to the specific job requirement. This approach ensures that the LLM analyzes job requirements like an expert recruiter, relying solely on the provided information to minimize inaccuracies.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [12]
>>
