660 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The system utilizes the all-MiniLM-L6-v2 model, a lightweight sentence transformer, for text representation in semantic search tasks, striking a balance between high performance and speed. To enhance information retrieval, documents are divided into smaller segments, which is particularly beneficial for lengthy resumes. The system employs recursive chunking, iteratively segmenting the text based on predefined separators to create manageable pieces of approximately 1,024 characters, with a 50% overlap to preserve context between chunks.)
/E (The system utilizes the all-MiniLM-L6-v2 model, a lightweight sentence transformer, for text representation in semantic search tasks, striking a balance between high performance and speed. To enhance information retrieval, documents are divided into smaller segments, which is particularly beneficial for lengthy resumes. The system employs recursive chunking, iteratively segmenting the text based on predefined separators to create manageable pieces of approximately 1,024 characters, with a 50% overlap to preserve context between chunks.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
