<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (To efficiently manage and retrieve dense vectors, the system utilizes Facebook AI Similarity Search \(FAISS\). The resume embeddings and original text chunks are indexed into a vector space using a flat index that prioritizes accuracy over speed, ensuring reliable retrieval.)
/E (To efficiently manage and retrieve dense vectors, the system utilizes Facebook AI Similarity Search \(FAISS\). The resume embeddings and original text chunks are indexed into a vector space using a flat index that prioritizes accuracy over speed, ensuring reliable retrieval.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
675 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Cosine distance is employed as the similarity measure. FAISS retrieves the most similar resume chunks for each sub-query and ranks them accordingly. To enhance the final document rankings, Reciprocal Rank Fusion \(RRF\) aggregates the inverse ranks from multiple lists into a new score for each document. This process produces a re-ranked list of documents that accurately reflects their relevance)
/E (Cosine distance is employed as the similarity measure. FAISS retrieves the most similar resume chunks for each sub-query and ranks them accordingly. To enhance the final document rankings, Reciprocal Rank Fusion \(RRF\) aggregates the inverse ranks from multiple lists into a new score for each document. This process produces a re-ranked list of documents that accurately reflects their relevance)
/Alt ()
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
